    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52365f260db8ff3af313196c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终直线，统治地位猛烈地开始冲刺！\n速度不断攀升，转眼间就追上了先行队列……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a41ddca5d4f12d4d9bf737671ced763d3aeac5d1ef8517c6d84fba0b353da20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
