    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e8270fa3d7b363bdbad9fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂，统治地位！！\n——啊啊，真是的……太让人操心了…………。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4898b95aa8efb016aad54072a490c45cc8bf32b60b6fb3cd7529becda7bc0ce5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9017a9b290e5e1c76304722a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来，她在精神层面是相当让人操心的类型。\n……但是，我从她的奔跑中确实感受到了资质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5426ea27232c614f1ecc66ca2befeabf8b542e12d72e338f12f115b1015c0690",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
