    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1b04bad9168111f4a8641b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈，抱歉啊。难得你那么憧憬我，却打碎了你的幻想。\n哎呀哈哈——………………我回去了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "183c829c211864587184d9e8648af215ef70d41d428c4e8228a3ebe4619160a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a939c1525718cb1bd257283",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（正因如此，才觉得可惜啊……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0003fb1e88c7681c42946a3690e5d482a947f76559054598ad604195e2c321ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb26429feeac757c32ba1c34",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相信在闪耀系列赛中，她也一定能取得GⅠ级别的活跃表现。\n她拥有如此舒展有力的双腿，以及绝佳的头脑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af367c03300e67c5f9395673c3871da9194e8e9b486d4416e696b7f9ef51b2c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
