      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6de4aefddbed5e40a1658023",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "统治地位！ 你差不多该出来了，不然我就要强行——\n啊！？ 你、你这家伙……！ 竟然上了反锁……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7caa3e89e9ffdefe03e0ebae2ad9681bac862af915d402e6af9b8db85db27383",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:605cee8ddcd11df87cb4520a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……网游那边，情况怎么样了呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceaddf934b1f5b268dc1be3f522f55692391269196612e5870c93d43fbc374ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d49e5f961848c6e82d4774c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那之后过了几天——统治地位似乎一直在翘掉训练。\n倒不如说，她窝在大本营闭门不出的态度反而变得更加顽固了……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31df044cfffccbbc457edf05d4192fe01e837f7dabb07419fc16b42560cb4ada",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa3b82594065f826f1720010",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『domi大佬，要不要来对战一把』……发送",
      "source_fingerprint": "587a4ba7a9756a5a6a415600aa6820b3ebb232dfc1d85eec198815bc2d284c28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06e89e5c557224c8fd072823",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我试着登录了往常玩的黑白棋网游。\n——在呢。『dominare』大佬正大摇大摆地在线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2130f553bebd96748b52d49d79db3ca7782e3086ba2e981748f26c82aa9dc3d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc8a1fa09ee4bd35b402bce2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这、这是在闹别扭啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcb38d9b6623ffc2a8d56192cdff0bfdaafe3fba878c79c705c96e5b5f6205eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d4fdb595cf897c648d5fa01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……几分钟后，收到了聊天回复。\n――――『你对我幻灭了吧』",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f4b09b0cb7b308c79a6beb044544933444f1f803a95109ed973214ec2436e6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c215b5daaefe7ad9779de8e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我拼命向她解释说，自己不仅没有幻灭，domi大佬\n现在依然是我憧憬的玩家，而且搭话也是想向她请教10×10的战术——",
      "source_fingerprint": "a215e7b1b86988f184e2255ae0fc3174cb975adf44f9f763066882df5776323b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b45e59d29e391acd3cb15aff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『太感谢了！请多指教，domi大佬』",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2c43f6d6f64a071957b95204c16458878c5c98718b48a4bbd1e448e688240c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
