    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9739035d075e2fd32a21793",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，不仅“边”被我的棋子越占越多。\n而且你能下的步子也已经被限制住了……死局！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51b86143591f5ca47f2de2fbde0549a1c146d4a5ac32478972edd762331812c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
