    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90e47e6b1bd6d17524370fe1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "10×10的棋局，更需要在序盘和中盘保持耐心。\n一点一点地剥夺对手的下棋空间，这点非常重要。",
      "source_fingerprint": "deb67a22605889a8d75adc8deacf3a2522f739b32d6b8b3e11153693351d317e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
