    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68033f432c8fdf603f68d76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵……那是。在中盘前让对手多吃点子，\n到了终盘再一口气翻盘——这可是黑白棋的定式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11291771253a8749a3f37ee1161430dc9141f474ad40d157c376f0e4d6d73ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
