    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ae9353b1e0eacbf530003d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那当然，我可是从骨子里就是个头脑清晰、运动神经超群的天才啊！\n就算是第一次参加的赛事我也取得了压倒性的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ca4f686de772f178dc89eeae825ebe44dfddf87fbd3b0683a0f993a384f982",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
